        {
          "_key": "f79c58f256c9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Every year, thousands of Nepali students dream of studying abroad—but for many, financial barriers can seem impossible to overcome. The good news? "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c6ea3d1f19b5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "International scholarships for Nepali students"
        },
        {
          "_key": "045e273c8abf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " are unlocking doors to quality education around the world. With the right guidance and preparation, these opportunities can become your path to a successful global career."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e163c5eb9558",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "69b9cdafa67a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At "
        },
        {
          "_key": "610c09d83aee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Admizz Education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2f6f4ec2d8ab",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", we specialize in helping students secure scholarships and gain admission to leading international universities. Whether you’re aiming for undergraduate, postgraduate, or research programs, we’re here to walk with you every step of the way."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d4179ef2968f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e50e8ff40d4e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why International Scholarships Matter"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2d5ab05af03a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "66773a295931",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For Nepali students, international scholarships are more than just financial aid—they’re a life-changing opportunity. Scholarships can cover tuition fees, living expenses, travel costs, and more. More importantly, they allow deserving students to focus on academic and personal growth without the burden of financial stress."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c669495222ab",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4c465770b7fc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Some key benefits of securing an international scholarship include:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0042bdc08a1e",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "edf975f77d7a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Access to world-class education"
